abstract: "Convert AutoCAD DWG/DXF, Netcad NCZ/NCA drawings, KML/KMZ, GML, GeoJSON, CSV, SpatiaLite, GPX, DGN, and GDB datasets directly into optimized GeoPackage layers with QGIS styling, batch spatial extent filtering, and 1-click Web Map Tiles MBTiles raster pyramid export."
